WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.357
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.357 --> 00:00:05.254
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.254 --> 00:00:08.754
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:08.754 --> 00:00:09.090
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.150
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.788
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:14.797 --> 00:00:19.940
Enter fictional names for a demonstration assessment.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:24.387
Assign two points to the training criterion.

00:00:24.387 --> 00:00:32.262
Write specific feedback about parameter updates.

00:00:32.262 --> 00:00:35.542
Reveal the chapter evidence for the training criterion.

00:00:35.542 --> 00:00:40.016
Assign one point to the incomplete inference explanation.

00:00:40.016 --> 00:00:48.606
Write an actionable improvement for the inference criterion.

00:00:48.606 --> 00:00:54.463
Reveal expected evidence about ordinary inference.

00:00:54.463 --> 00:00:58.998
Assign two points to the context and retrieval criterion.

00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:08.113
Write feedback on retrieval and source checking.

00:01:08.113 --> 00:01:11.402
Reveal the chapter evidence about context and retrieval.

00:01:11.402 --> 00:01:23.258
Write an overall strength and a concrete improvement.

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:26.605
Finalize the demonstration assessment.

00:01:26.605 --> 00:01:29.352
Inspect the finalized scores and written feedback.

00:01:29.352 --> 00:01:36.438
Reset the rubric and return to the unscored progress.
